ColAndreas / CADB
-----------------

The CADB *file format* is documented in ColAndreas (Pottus/ColAndreas, GPL-3.0).
This repository contains an original parser written from that format description;
it is not a copy of ColAndreas source. File formats themselves are not
copyrightable, but:

  If you later copy ColAndreas source (or a derivative) into this tree and
  distribute the result, GPL-3.0 obligations of ColAndreas apply to that
  combined work.

GTA San Andreas collision (.col) and map data are copyright Rockstar Games and
must not be redistributed. This project ships only a synthetic test city.
